      "metric": "liveness_rate_union",
      "comparator": ">=",
      "value": 0.8,
      "units": "proportion"
    },
    "h0": "H0: union liveness < 80% \u2014 genuine dead wires remain (frozen even under their own trigger); worklist non-empty",
